          "| Primary environment under test | `Local demo app — examples/fleetkeep/demo-app in the harness template` |"
        ],
        [
          "| Issue tracker project key | `<e.g. PROJ>` |",
          "| Issue tracker project key | `FK` |"
        ],
        [
          "| Issue key format | `<e.g. PROJ-1234>` —",
          "| Issue key format | `FK-1234` —"
